# treadle 1
type Sorting class
	namespace Core
	access internal
	static
	doc "The sort behind List.Sort, Arrays.Sort and Span.Sort: an introsort (quicksort with a median-of-three pivot, insertion sort for ranges of 16 or fewer, heapsort when the partitions go deeper than 2 log2 n), in place and not stable. Each step has two versions: one orders with a comparer delegate (the By functions), the other with T's operator < (no call per comparison). Elements move bit for bit (Core-Library.md 3.1): no destructor runs on the temporaries."

function s0001 Swap
	static
	unsafe
	access internal
	generic T
	doc "Exchanges the elements at `a` and `b`, bit for bit."
param a T*
param b T*
local t T
