function n0005 Intro
	static
	unsafe
	access internal
	generic T operator<
	doc "Introsort of the elements from `lo` up to (not including) `hi`: quicksort partitions around the median of the first, middle and last elements (Hoare's scheme, so runs of equal elements split evenly); the smaller side is sorted by a recursive call, the larger by the loop; ranges of 16 or fewer elements go to Insertion, and a range still partitioning after `depth` rounds goes to Heap."
